cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use OntoGSN, please cite the paper below. To cite the ontology itself, use the software metadata in this file."
type: software
title: "OntoGSN"
abstract: >-
  An ontology for managing assurance cases in the Goal Structuring Notation
  (GSN). It links the elements of a case - claims and evidence - to the
  internationalized resource identifiers (IRIs) of the concepts, events and data
  they stand for, and supports evaluating the validity of the argument. Every
  term is sourced from the Goal Structuring Notation Community Standard v3
  (SCSC-141C).
